<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The licence screen, in Greek.

  Not a literal rendering of the English: the sentences are written the way a
  speaker of this language would say them. A literal translation of a status
  message produces a grammatical sentence that leaves the reader unsure what to
  do, which is the one thing this screen cannot afford.

  No string here contains a price, a currency symbol, a period or a number of
  days. Those come from PlanOffer and EntitlementState, formatted in this
  locale's own conventions at the point of use.

  "Subscription" belongs to the provider. Castivio sells a licence.
-->
